// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Mairenn MacGregor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3031449606" "Mairenn MacGregor"
// LocationString :
"P2752802251" "Atlas Park"
// ProfessionString :
"P4244988493" "Containment Specialist"
// DescriptionString :
"P3383766943" "Mairenn MacGregor is a containment specialist working for Freedom Corp. Slight in stature but not in bravery, tenacity, or attitude, Mairenn is charged with managing threats to Paragon citizens' safety. <br><br>The sewers, in particular, have become an increasing headache for Mairenn. She has discovered that while the Hydra within can be contained, it cannot be destroyed. <br><br>Her current assignment is to organize and dispatch small groups of heroes to deal with this ongoing threat."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P982666749" "I need heroes with serious dedication. If you think you have what it takes to help me, then I can definitely use your help. <br><br>What do you say, {HeroName}? Are you up to it? That threat in the sewers seriously needs to be contained."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P165700984" "I'm not going to lie to you. This will be tough. So you'll need to come back to me when you reach Security Level 38. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 38. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared down to Security Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P1353844742" "I appreciate your willingness to help, {HeroName}, but this task is below you now. I'm sure there are others who could use your help now. <br><br>But hey, if you know of anyone who would be right for this, do me a favor and send them over. This headache looks like it's not going away any time soon. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Security Level 38. If they are over Security Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared down to Security Level 40 for the duration of the task force."
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P1740677072" "This is not a task to be taken on lightly...or alone. You WILL need help with this. Come back with at least three other heroes. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Security Level 38. If they are over Security Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared down to Security Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force."
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P656601308" "I need to talk to your team leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P854729180" "Hm. Not everyone's here yet. When the entire team has assembled, I'll give you the details."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1293851079" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for this task. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Security Level 38. If they are over Security Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Security Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force."
// TaskForceName :
"P687362206" "Cutios"
// TaskForceName :
"P2423329289" "Equos"
// TaskForceName :
"P494451590" "Cantlos"
// TaskForceName :
"P658373674" "Riuros"
// HelloString :
"P1730714147" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hello, {HeroName}. These sewers are really starting to be a headache for me. Do you think you have what it takes to help me?</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3109597599" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have a really serious situation in the sewers that needs handling by a team of competent heroes.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2198719890" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey, {HeroName}, this is a big one. Think you can handle it?</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2785808276" "Hmmm&<br><br>Should I recognize you? I only ask because you don't seem familiar and no one's told me about you. Why don't you come back later? Maybe by then someone will have passed on a word about you to me. <br><br>I'm very big on referrals."
// FirstVisitString :
"P404708417" "Hey, {HeroName}. I've heard a lot about all the great things you've been doing for Paragon City. Word about you is pretty impressive, to say the least. You just might be the kind of hero I'm looking for."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2834932368" "I appreciate everything that you've done for me, but it's time to move on. There are others who need you now."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1667480015" "You're kidding, right? This is one task you can't juggle. Maybe your other ones you could, but not this one. I need full concentration and there's no leeway on this. <br><br> Seriously. I need you free and clear. Why don't you go clean off your plate and then come back and see me?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3602404047" "Hey, {HeroName}. I admire your bravery, but you're not yet strong enough to take on a task of this size. You would get seriously hurt. But I do want you to come back when you're Security Level {Level}. I know I will need you then.<br><br>Don't forget!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2303864365" "WOW!<br><br>You blew me away, {HeroName}. That was some great work. I'm going to write down your name and you should definitely call me any time you need me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3357057098" "{HeroName}, you rock. Seriously. If I were ever in a bind, you'd be the one I'd call."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2795972436" "I don't talk to villains, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P459554734" "Well, it's time to move on, {HeroName}. I'm sad to see you go because you've done some great things for me, but there are others who need you now."
// IntroString :
"P856364347" ""
